OL,5,G1800 Get It On with Bryan Burnett
OL,6,     FBack in 1986, Queen famously
OL,7,     Fheaded behind the iron curtain to
OL,8,     Fplay a gig in Budapest, so
OL,9,     Ftonight, we want to know where was
OL,10,     Fthe most unusual place you went to
OL,11,     Fsee an artist play.
OL,12,G2000 Vic Galloway
OL,13,     FThis week's Triple AAA album is
OL,14,     FThe Harder They Come, the classic
OL,15,     Fsoundtrack to the 1972 film
OL,16,     Fstarring Jimmy Cliff. Plus Tom Tom
OL,17,     FClub, Cocteau Twins, Idlewild,
OL,18,     FMike D & Beck.
OL,19,G2200 Up Late
OL,20,     FThe best company to end the day,
OL,21,     Fwith lively chat and some of your
OL,22,     Ffavourite tunes.
